1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,370
(Sheldon:)I'm unhappy.

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,170
(Leonard:)This is delicious.

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,420
(Leonard:)Where'd you learn
to make chili?

4
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,610
(Priya:)When I was at
university in England,

5
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:10,110
(Priya:)my flatmate was
from Texas.

6
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:13,750
(Leonard:)I hope she wasn't anything
like my flatmate from Texas.

7
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:16,250
(Priya:)Sheldon is a bit
quirky, isn't he?

8
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:18,320
(Howard:)Oh, please.
That crazy bastard's looking

9
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:21,460
(Howard:)at quirky
in the rearview mirror.

10
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:25,630
(Leonard:)Did you know that,
per our roommate agreement,

11
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:28,200
(Leonard:)I have to wash my feet
before I get in the shower?

12
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,230
(Leonard:)And not in the sink.

13
00:00:29,230 --> 00:00:31,730
(Leonard:)We each have special buckets.

14
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:33,770
(Howard:)Raj, did you ever
tell your sister

15
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:36,040
(Howard:)about the time Sheldon
got punched by Bill Gates?

16
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:38,210
- Oh, God, you're kidding.
- Nope.

17
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:39,940
(Raj:)Gates gave a speech
at the university.

18
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,580
(Raj:)Sheldon went up to him
afterwards and said,

19
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:43,280
"Maybe if you weren't
so distracted

20
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,750
(Raj:)by sick children in Africa,

21
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:47,680
(Raj:)you could have put a little more
thought into Windows Vista."

22
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:50,320
(all laughing)

23
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:52,450
(Leonard:)Bam. Right in the nose.

24
00:00:52,450 --> 00:00:55,890
(Leonard:)Made me proud to own a PC.

25
00:00:55,890 --> 00:00:57,960
(Raj:)I'd like to propose a toast

26
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:00,560
(Raj:)to a rare and wonderful
Sheldon-free evening.

